                      %mi A
                      %mo →
                      %mi A
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \Lambda_*\colon k \times A \times A \to A
                that satisfies some equations; an affine linear map is a function that preserves this operation (the “one ternary operation” definition).
            %li
              %p
                An affine space over the field
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %mi k
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} k
                is an inhabited set
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %mi A
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} A
                together with, for every
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/natural+number"} natural number
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
