          %h3#ClosedMonoidal Closed monoidal structure
          %p
            If we allow affine spaces to be empty, then they are the models of an
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/algebraic+theory"} algebraic theory
            = succeed "." do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
